 "books": {},
 "gossip": {
  "10378|8b4f80e7": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Omusa Thunderhorn",
   "npc": "10378",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Though the Crossroads seems to be the center of activity in The Barrens, I prefer the quietude of Camp Taurajo.  Where shall I send you?",
   "time": 1791636850,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "10668|19e45338": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Beaten Corpse",
   "npc": "10668",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The body is that of a female orc warrior.\n\nIt is clear that she died in battle, probably against the quilboar in the area.",
   "time": 1791636613,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "10668|36aec325": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Beaten Corpse",
   "npc": "10668",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You turn the body over and see the marks from blades and spells upon the deceased orc--her armor all but destroyed, her hair matted to her face.\n\nBased on Mankrik's description of her, there is no doubt in your mind that this was his wife.\n\nHe will be upset by the news, but you are sure he should know the truth.",
   "time": 1791636613,
   "title": "I inspect the body further.",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "16227|c5ceacbe": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Bragok",
   "npc": "16227",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Where would you like to fly to?",
   "time": 1791644491,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "248199|4ee395b7": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Beneris",
   "npc": "248199",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Oh! Greetings, friend. Feel free to browse my wares.",
   "time": 1791637302,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "256388|13e9970d": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Jornah",
   "npc": "256388",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Greetings and well met, $N! Your arrival is timely, and we here at the Durotar Supply and Logistics company are always in need of new contractors.\r\n\r\nIf you are someone with a knack for gathering useful materials or the skills to craft something from scratch, you have a place here.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you have any questions.",
   "time": 1791637283,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "256388|631ab615": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Jornah",
   "npc": "256388",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Recently there has been a sharp rise in lost orders. We strive to ensure that each delivery is efficient and safe, but with a rise of bandits, rowdy creatures, and those damned Alliance, inevitably not every delivery goes according to plan.\r\n\r\nShould you find these shipments, take a look over the label for what it should contain. It is not your responsibility to deal with our mistakes, but if you complete the shipment, you will be rewarded in kind. \r\n\r\nDokimi over by the wagon can handle the logistics and your compensation. We will take it from there.",
   "time": 1791637281,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "256388|6df3de7b": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Jornah",
   "npc": "256388",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Yes! Well. Sort of.\r\n\r\nGold is the true universal currency, but we have our own system for trade amongst ourselves known as Merchant's Favor. It abstracts away the ever-fluctuating value of gold and silver, and ensures fair and equitable trade between members of the organization. It cannot be liquidated to gold, unless you're engaging in some shady activity, I suppose.\r\n\r\nWe still use gold for typical day-to-day needs such as materials needed for common crafts, but otherwise rely on Merchant's Favor for any kind of internal commerce.\r\n\r\nIf you assist us with recovering waylaid crates and ensuring swift fulfillment of craftsman's writs, you will earn plenty!",
   "time": 1791637285,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3310|cc0cf280": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Doras",
   "npc": "3310",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider.",
   "time": 1791639122,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "3389|5612724d": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Regthar Deathgate",
   "npc": "3389",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde.",
   "time": 1791638547,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3391|8f749700": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Gazlowe",
   "npc": "3391",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Thrall paid me and my boys well for helping out with the construction of Orgrimmar, so I decided to set up a port here. We do most of our business through Booty Bay and Baron Revilgaz.",
   "time": 1791639326,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3430|0e16a4d2": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mangletooth",
   "npc": "3430",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You! $R! Come here. <snort>\n\nTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>\n\nMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!\n\nThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth.",
   "time": 1791636842,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3432|c1a3099b": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mankrik",
   "npc": "3432",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.\n\nHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!",
   "time": 1791637049,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3448|dcea3712": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tonga Runetotem",
   "npc": "3448",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
   "time": 1791638725,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3615|ddd7878b": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Devrak",
   "npc": "3615",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "My wind riders are trained to fly quickly through the hot Barrens air.",
   "time": 1791638767,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "6018|10137e12": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1454,
   "name": "Ur'kyo",
   "npc": "6018",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for.",
   "time": 1791638961,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Orgrimmar"
  },
  "7714|e013de07": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Priest",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Innkeeper Byula",
   "npc": "7714",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "As the wind on the plains, you are always welcome here.",
   "time": 1791636824,
